                                                "example_id": "521ed64c-4e76-4228-acd9-2828233d6a79",
                                                "sense_id": "e9a60a96-ebbb-3eb6-9265-6bf43f451a23",
                                                "text": "Her eyes hurt and when her mother looked at her in the morning and worried that she had Apollo because her eyes were so red she did not tell her otherwise."
